{"id":"ayahuasca","name":"Ayahuasca","form":"dropper","status":"Documented","aliases":"pharmahuasca, yage","category":"Psychedelic","psychoactiveClass":"Psychedelic","addictionPotential":"not habit-forming","toxicity":["LD50 is around 50 times a regular dose"],"summarySources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","summary":"A concoction made of two or more plants that contain at least an MAOI and DMT, the combination of which allows the DMT to work orally. Typically associated to South American cultures. The drug is sometimes approximated synthetically by taking an external MAOI with extracted DMT. The drug is reported to often cause intense, spiritually orientated hallucinogenic experiences.","advisory":"Combining with any medications or substance contraindicated with MAOI's particuarly SSRI's, MDxx compounds and Amphetamines. Refer to http://wiki.tripsit.me/images/d/d6/TripSitDrugComboChart.gif for more info.","doseMaxTick":100,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Oral","onset":"20–60 min","comeup":"—","peak":"1–2 h","offset":"1–2 h","afterEffects":"1–8 h","total":"5–10 h"}],"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"8B Geometry - Exposure to inner mechanics of consciousness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/8B_Geometry_-_Exposure_to_inner_mechanics_of_consciousness"},{"name":"Acuity enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Acuity_enhancement"},{"name":"After images","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/After_images"},{"name":"Analysis enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Analysis_enhancement"},{"name":"Auditory distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_distortion"},{"name":"Auditory enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_enhancement"},{"name":"Auditory hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_hallucinations"},{"name":"Autonomous entities","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Autonomous_entities"},{"name":"Colour enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Colour_enhancement"},{"name":"Colour shifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Colour_shifting"},{"name":"Conceptual thinking","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Conceptual_thinking"},{"name":"Creativity enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Creativity_enhancement"},{"name":"Déjà vu","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/D%C3%A9j%C3%A0_vu"},{"name":"Delusions","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Delusions"},{"name":"Diarrhea","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Diarrhea"},{"name":"Drifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Drifting"},{"name":"Emotion enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Emotion_enhancement"},{"name":"Exposure to inner mechanics of consciousness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Exposure_to_inner_mechanics_of_consciousness"},{"name":"Feelings of eternalism","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Feelings_of_eternalism"},{"name":"Feelings of interdependent opposites","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Feelings_of_interdependent_opposites"},{"name":"Feelings of self-design","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Feelings_of_self-design"},{"name":"Geometry","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Geometry"},{"name":"Immersion enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Immersion_enhancement"},{"name":"Internal hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Internal_hallucinations"},{"name":"Language suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Language_suppression"},{"name":"Magnification","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Magnification"},{"name":"Memory suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Memory_suppression"},{"name":"Mindfulness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Mindfulness"},{"name":"Nausea","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Nausea"},{"name":"Novelty enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Novelty_enhancement"},{"name":"Pattern recognition enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Pattern_recognition_enhancement"},{"name":"Personal bias suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Personal_bias_suppression"},{"name":"Personal meaning enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Personal_meaning_enhancement"},{"name":"Personality regression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Personality_regression"},{"name":"Perspective alterations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Perspective_alterations"},{"name":"Pupil dilation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Pupil_dilation"},{"name":"Rejuvenation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Rejuvenation"},{"name":"Scenarios and plots","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Scenarios_and_plots"},{"name":"Scenery slicing","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Scenery_slicing"},{"name":"Sedation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Sedation"},{"name":"Settings, sceneries, and landscapes","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Settings,_sceneries,_and_landscapes"},{"name":"Spirituality enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Spirituality_enhancement"},{"name":"Spontaneous tactile sensations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Spontaneous_tactile_sensations"},{"name":"Stimulation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Stimulation"},{"name":"Subconscious communication","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Subconscious_communication"},{"name":"Symmetrical texture repetition","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Symmetrical_texture_repetition"},{"name":"Synaesthesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Synaesthesia"},{"name":"Thought acceleration","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_acceleration"},{"name":"Thought connectivity","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_connectivity"},{"name":"Thought organization","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_organization"},{"name":"Euphoria"},{"name":"Empathy"},{"name":"Insight"},{"name":"Brightened colour"},{"name":"Closed/Open eye visuals"},{"name":"Enhanced tactile sensation"},{"name":"Mental/physical stimulation"},{"name":"Decreased appetite"},{"name":"Restlessness"},{"name":"Change in perception"},{"name":"Ego softening"},{"name":"Sweating/chills"},{"name":"Muscle tension"},{"name":"Confusion"},{"name":"Insomnia"}],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Ayahuasca"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/ayahuasca"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_Ayahuasca.shtml"}],"warnings":[{"text":"A 19-year-old died of multiple organ failure in January 2023 after taking 24 ephedrine asthma tablets, then drinking a home brew of Syrian rue (harmala) and acacia bark boiled for over an hour and a half. Harmala alkaloids are MAOIs: with ephedrine or any other stimulant they can push blood pressure high enough to cause bleeding in the brain and heart failure. Acacia bark can hold 5-MeO-DMT, which is dangerous with an MAOI, and bark bought online may carry pesticides. Have a sober sitter, and put knives and sharp things away first.","source":"Source: FreeODwiki, report RP-74.","url":"https://freeodwiki.org/%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/%E8%A1%A5%E6%A1%A3/Overdosewiki/Report/RP-74.html"}]}